3. AGPL-3.0-only  (LICENSES/AGPL-3.0-only.txt, mirrored at LICENSE-AGPL)  -- the default
   Everything else: all first-party code and configuration (scripts, .github/**, Makefile,
   bedrock.agda-lib), and default-covered documentation (AGENTS.md,
   CONTRIBUTING.md, NOTICE, this file). Outcrop's independent submodule preserves
   its own per-file terms for the renderer, website resources and 1lab vendor tree
   (Copyright (C) 2021 Amelia Liao and contributors). See outcrop/REUSE.toml and NOTICE.

The three LICENSE-* files in the repository root duplicate the LICENSES/ texts so GitHub's
